WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.280
 From one month to another, the quality of output AI generated is like 10 times better.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:12.720
 90% of the AI generated content is like pure slop, but 10% is 10 times better than human output, right?

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.360
 At the end of the day, like good content is good content.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.480
 Just give it a few more months and people won't see the difference.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.320
 Right now, if you have the really good models,

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.920
 you already don't see a difference between AI and a real image.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:29.120
 When 70% of the content on the internet is AI generated, like what the fuck are you talking about?

